<div class="drawer-scrim" data-cart-scrim hidden></div><aside class="bag-drawer" data-cart-drawer aria-labelledby="DrawerTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="drawer-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">TU SELECCIÓN</p><h2 id="DrawerTitle">Mi pedido <span data-drawer-count>({{ cart.item_count }})</span></h2></div><button class="drawer-close" type="button" data-cart-close aria-label="Cerrar carrito">×</button></div><div class="drawer-content"><div class="empty-bag" data-cart-empty{% if cart.item_count > 0 %} hidden{% endif %}><span class="empty-icon"><img src="{{ 'nenufero-logo.png' | asset_url }}" alt=""></span><h3>Tu carrito está esperando una buena idea.</h3><p>Encuentra algo que te guste en la colección Nenufero.</p><button class="text-link" type="button" data-cart-close>Volver a la tienda ↓</button></div><div class="bag-items" data-cart-items>{% for item in cart.items %}<article class="bag-item" data-cart-key="{{ item.key }}"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{% if item.image %}{{ item.image | image_url: width: 180 | image_tag: widths: '90, 180', loading: 'lazy', alt: item.image.alt }}{% endif %}</a><div><a href="{{ item.url }}"><h3>{{ item.product.title | escape }}</h3></a><p>{% unless item.variant.title contains 'Default' %}{{ item.variant.title | escape }} · {% endunless %}{{ item.final_price | money }}</p><label class="drawer-item-quantity">Cantidad<input type="number" min="0" value="{{ item.quantity }}" data-cart-quantity aria-label="Cantidad de {{ item.product.title | escape }}"></label><button class="remove-item" type="button" data-cart-remove>Quitar</button></div><span class="bag-item-total">{{ item.final_line_price | money }}</span></article>{% endfor %}</div></div><div class="drawer-foot"><p>Envío e impuestos se calculan al pagar.</p><a class="button button-blue checkout-button" href="/checkout" data-cart-checkout{% if cart.item_count == 0 %} aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>Finalizar compra <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link drawer-checkout" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">Ver el carrito</a></div></aside>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Carrito lateral","settings":[]}
{% endschema %}
